	"FriendlyName": "PSOForge",
	"Description": "Developer-side PSO capture tool. Cycles every scalability preset in a cooked build while -logPSO recording is active, rendering all project materials and Niagara systems on representative geometry so real draw PSOs are created and recorded for a bundled PSO cache. Excluded from Shipping builds.",
